R"VG(
# lexicon.vg: the words of an age (H-03). A record of an earlier age that has one of them fails the anachronism check
# (`vgCheck`): the grammar must keep it behind a guard (`(age>=industrial)`). The words are listed as written (their forms),
# not as stems, so a word of another meaning that shares a stem is not caught ("bore" is not the industrial "bores").
# H-04: the words of an invention (`@lexicon inv.railway railway ...`): a record may write them only once the history has made it
# (the model's `inv.<key>` facts), so a railway does not run in the industrial age's first years; and writing itself is medieval
# (a people without it leaves marks, not words on a page).

@lexicon medieval iron coin coins ink book books codex codices scroll scrolls parchment sword swords steel castle castles cathedral
@lexicon medieval knight knights abbey monastery scribe scribes horseshoe horseshoes stela stelae lintel lintels
@lexicon medieval write writes wrote written writing letter letters page pages

@lexicon industrial railway railways railroad locomotive locomotives train trains factory factories steamer
@lexicon industrial steamship telegraph telegraphs telegram telegrams gaslight gaslamp gasworks ironworks newspaper newspapers gazette
@lexicon industrial photograph photographs camera cameras rifle rifles revolver revolvers phonograph phonographs dynamite boiler boilers
@lexicon industrial station stations penny census

@lexicon modern television televisions phone phones car cars motorcar motorcars truck trucks
@lexicon modern aeroplane aeroplanes airplane airplanes airport airports computer computers plastic rocket rockets
@lexicon modern satellite satellites transistor transistors reactor reactors atomic nuclear highway motorway
@lexicon modern frequency transmitter generator grid

@lexicon futuristic robot robots android androids fusion starship starships hologram holograms maglev arcology arcologies orbital
@lexicon futuristic spaceport spaceports cyborg cyborgs terraform terraformed terraforming nanite nanites habitat habitats

@lexicon farfuture ringworld megastructure megastructures uploaded dyson

@lexicon inv.railway railway railways train trains locomotive locomotives timetable
@lexicon inv.steam engine engines
@lexicon inv.telegraph telegraph telegraphs telegram telegrams
@lexicon inv.photography photograph photographs camera cameras
@lexicon inv.electric electric electricity
@lexicon inv.telephone telephone telephones
@lexicon inv.radio radio radios transmitter broadcast broadcasts
@lexicon inv.computer computer computers terminal terminals
@lexicon inv.press printed newspaper newspapers
)VG"
